{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pup Boy Cowboy</strong> puts you in the boots of Y4M, a bounty-hunter android who once lived a blissful life among humans\u2014even marrying the love of his life. But after her tragic passing (big sadge), Y4M spirals into despair, ready to go out in a blaze of glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just in time, one final mission lands in his lap: an old &quot;friend&quot; has been conducting some questionable experiments on local cows... and things have gone <i>horribly</i> wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you equipped to take them down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a classic arcade-style shooter featuring slick gameplay, goofy enemies, and increasing difficulty that\u2019ll push your reflexes to the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive as long as you can, unlock new skins (only on <i>Very Hard</i>, because why not), and chase high scores to flex how much free time you <i>definitely don\u2019t</i> have. Maybe your friends will finally want to hang out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656320/extras/PBC.gif?t=1745567898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PUP BOY COWBOY : Infinite Desert Edition is an enhanced version from the legacy version uploaded in October 2024, with improved gameplay, new secrets, and much more !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only this time... It's paid (Lame, I know...) BUT, This version will receive more active support than the legacy one, including new enemy types, new skins, and even more in the future.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Avoid The Noid!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656320/16cc2507be7d79266194b4c558137c891e25c380.jpg"},{"name":"Unpolished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656320/10beb353a544bd8e4fce08184d410a1dc1c3f6dd.jpg"},{"name":"The Soft Way","path":"https: